x \\\\  & ={\\int }_{0}^{3}(3x+\\frac{9}{2})\\,\\text{d}x \\\\  & =[\\frac{3{x}^{2}}{2}+\\frac{9x}{2}]_{x=0}^{x=3} \\\\  & =(\\frac{3\\cdot (3)^{2}}{2}+\\frac{9\\cdot (3)}{2})-0 \\\\  & =27.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNext, we have\n\n$$\n\\text{Area}(D)=3\\cdot 3=9.\n$$\n\nAlso, we are told that $a=2.$ So, our initial equation simplifies to\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}27 & =f(2,b)\\cdot 9 \\\\ 27 & =(2+b)\\cdot 9 \\\\ 27 & =9b+18 \\\\ 9 & =9b \\\\ b & =1.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNotice that $(2,1)\\in D.$ Therefore, the answer is $b=1.$" 13194139536155 true] [17592186386372 1000 #edb/ref 17592186386373 13194139536155 true] [17592186386372 1000 #edb/ref 17592186386374 13194139536155 true] [17592186386372 1000 #edb/ref 17592186386375 13194139536155 true] [17592186386372 1000 #edb/ref 17592186386376 13194139536155 true] [17592186386372 1000 #edb/ref 17592186386377 13194139536155 true] [17592186386372 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139536155 true] [17592186386372 1041 "selection" 13194139536155 true] [17592186386372 1104 #edb/ref 17592186386376 13194139536155 true] [17592186386372 1110 #uuid "351c7399-da34-5bf2-b03c-007352d08b71" 13194139536155 true] [17592186386373 1034 "\\frac{1}{2}" 13194139536155 true] [17592186386373 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536155 true] [17592186386373 1111 #uuid "a374ad7b-4037-5fe5-a477-1e23b9d73485" 13194139536155 true] [17592186386374 1034 "2" 13194139536155 true] [17592186386374 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536155 true] [17592186386374 1111 #uuid "1d1898d6-5be9-5fb5-bfa8-c236f5906511" 13194139536155 true] [17592186386375 1034 "\\frac{1}{4}" 13194139536155 true] [17592186386375 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536155 true] [17592186386375 1111 #uuid "2a2255ff-2eee-5576-83ba-4df11643b384" 13194139536155 true] [17592186386376 1034 "1" 13194139536155 true] [17592186386376 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139536155 true] [17592186386376 1111 #uuid "5a1688a3-9e6c-5505-aa46-444fdce3b7e7" 13194139536155 true] [17592186386377 1034 "\\fra